          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38:27",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Dalaanta: Dabicheanda ghayi adeeniida fuga Israeli haleanjeeda aba damandida, geeteena gharinga ea lapiya ea dahaabu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " apughala bea lapiyaan geesissa hoorgajeega heeda ghaydit, ea hoorgajeega heeda hang'da beashooda, hoorgaji bughala aba dalaantajeesu apughalaan nea dalaantajeanjagi gaba hoorgeanagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea lapiyeeni was bughalaji ispwa ea laadam ea damanamuudiin, gwasin iidiga daranajeega, ak gwadukuta iheenga ak gwasissa ng'ooruutka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak lagheanga oomng'i siyeadu gaba dalaantaji laadam ea damanamughuush ea lapiyaji sagalamnyooji iyeenya ea bughalaji ang'wan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwasina lagheang'su oomng'iin hoorgajeega gidaghuuta maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, ea lagheanga oomng'i bea heeda wagiida ea gharinyeanda oomu mideawa seawuutka ea haleanjeeda sean bea heeda wagiida, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea hoorgajeega neaweesa seamooda, ea hoorgajeega mida gidaghuuta seamooda, ea guhuunatka sean bea maheemajeanda, ea guhuunatka sean neaweesa seamooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.31",
